  robertsBurk:["Roberts, History of Lehigh County, Pennsylvania (1914): \u201cPeter Burkhalter, the son of Ulrich Burkhalter, was born December 2, 1731, and accompanied his parents to America from Switzerland, arriving at Philadelphia on September 28, 1733\u201d \u2014 with the 300-acre purchase from Richard Hockley on 4 February 1743, the deed of gift to his only son Peter in 1754, Ulrich\u2019s death in 1762, and Peter\u2019s election to the Constitutional Convention on 8 July 1776","https://archive.org/stream/historyoflehighc01robe/historyoflehighc01robe_djvu.txt"],
